complaint.body:
I am a New Jersey resident. I asked {{source_name}} ({{source_website}}) to delete my personal data and stop selling it, under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}). As far as I can tell, the company did not complete or answer the request within the response period. I ask the Division to review whether the law applies to this company and whether it complied.

Request sent on: {{sent_date}}
Response period ended on: {{due_date}}
Listing still shown on: {{recheck_date}}
Listing address: {{profile_url}}

I can provide a copy of my request and its date, and the records of the listing that I kept.

{{full_name}}
Contact email: {{email}}

followUp.body:
To {{source_name}},

I am following up on my request under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}) to delete my personal data and stop selling it.

Request sent on: {{sent_date}}
Response period ended on: {{due_date}}
Listing on your site: {{profile_url}}

I have not received a response, an extension notice or a decision I can appeal. Please complete the deletion and confirm in writing, or tell me why you cannot and how I can appeal. If I do not hear from you, or if an appeal is denied, I may contact the New Jersey Division of Consumer Affairs.

{{full_name}}
{{date}}

request.body:
To {{source_name}},

I am a New Jersey resident. Under the New Jersey Data Privacy Act ({{citation}}), I request that you:

1. Delete the personal data you hold about me.
2. Stop selling my personal data, and stop processing it for targeted advertising and for profiling in furtherance of decisions that produce legal or similarly significant effects.

Details to identify my record (please use them only for this request):
Name: {{full_name}}
My address: {{address}}
Listing on your site: {{profile_url}}
Contact email for this request: {{email}}

If you cannot verify that this request comes from me, please tell me what additional information is reasonably necessary. The law asks for a response within {{response_days}} days of receiving a verified request. If you need more time, please tell me within that period and explain why. If you decline any part of this request, please tell me why and how I can appeal.

Please confirm in writing when the deletion is complete.

Thank you,
{{full_name}}
{{date}}

